OL,3,GNEWSACollege lecturer who killed couple
OL,4,Ain drink-drive crash jailed for six
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former college lecturer who admitted
OL,8,Fkilling a husband and wife in a head-on
OL,9,Fcrash after drinking at a work
OL,10,FChristmas party has been jailed for six
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FSophie Hynd caused the deaths of
OL,14,FJatinder Kaur, 48, and her husband,
OL,15,FSatwant Singh, 64, in Cluny in Fife
OL,16,Flast year.
OL,18,FThe 33-year-old, who lost her job as a
OL,19,Fcomputer animation lecturer at Fife
OL,20,FCollege in Kirkcaldy, had been drinking
OL,21,Fon-and-off for nine hours before the
OL,22,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
