OL,3,GNEWSACollege lecturer who killed couple
OL,4,Ain drink-drive crash jailed for six
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FHynd pled guilty to the offence at a
OL,8,Fhearing last month and was also banned
OL,9,Ffrom driving for 10 years during
OL,10,Fsentencing at the High Court in
OL,11,FEdinburgh.
